//
// nmap-mac-prefixes itself aggregates the three public IEEE Registration Authority MAC
// address block registries -- MA-L (the classic 24-bit OUI), MA-M (28-bit), and MA-S
// (36-bit) -- each block owner's registered organization name is public registry DATA,
